nge conversation with Toma. But when Toma follows up on his hunch he discovers that the real culprit is not Misha but his own father. As such he hurries to reach his father before Misha and the other mages can confront him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-01-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/czgbqOd83Z1KOIaZseAaPyiSMvQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/czgbqOd83Z1KOIaZseAaPyiSMvQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30980/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"749478","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After figuring out the truth of Misha’s real identity, Kanzaki sends Kamijo and Toya to destroy the ritual spot. When Tsuchimikado suggests that Toya must die for the spell to end, a violent – and seemingly fatal – encounter ensues.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-01-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6.9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ckmPRnfPkZnl343bG0mJjlm68On.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ckmPRnfPkZnl343bG0mJjlm68On.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30980/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"749479","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In order to shake off the unwanted attention she’s getting from Unabara, Misaka asks Kamijo to pretend to be her boyfriend. Things get complicated when the faux-couple discovers that Unabara is hiding a magical secret.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-02-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.1,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dWcXv33dZTAjw3Po9aDPLPXPeEu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dWcXv33dZTAjw3Po9aDPLPXPeEu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":